# Project Sentinel

## Overview

Project Sentinel is an AI-assisted smart surveillance platform designed to add intelligent security and event analysis capabilities to CCTV systems.

## Goal

Build a practical, low-cost surveillance intelligence system that can analyze camera footage, detect important events, record evidence, and provide useful information to a business owner.

## Core Features

- Person and vehicle detection
- Motion and event detection
- Camera identification
- Event timestamps
- Evidence snapshots
- Event history
- Configurable detection zones
- Local/offline-first processing
- Dashboard and analytics
- Smart alerts

## Hardware

Current CCTV hardware:

- 2 × Hikvision DS-2CE16C0T-IR
- 2 × Hikvision DS-2CE16D1T-IT3
- Tenda S108 network switch

Additional hardware will be integrated as the project develops.

